    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:45:55.137+09:00">【题解】《本生》继《孟春》之后，仍着力阐述人应当为其生而行事。“本生“，即生命的延续是其根本。为此，文章指出应重视人的生命而轻视外物。在人与外物的关系上，凡“利于性者则取之，害于性者则舍之”。有了钱财，不要去追求骄奢淫逸的生活，以保全生命的长寿。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:51:25.413+09:00">能够养育天所创造的生命，而又不去触犯生命成长的人就叫天子。【之：前一个作结构助词，后一个作代词，代生命。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:50:46.661+09:00">第二是：开始创造生命的，【之：代生命。下句“养成之“中”之”字同。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:50:52.748+09:00">是天；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:50:59.176+09:00">养育生命并使之成长的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:51:07.758+09:00">是人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:51:37.865+09:00">天子的一举一动，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:51:44.58+09:00">以保全天所创造的生命为其要务。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:51:55.66+09:00">这就是职官所以设立的原因。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:55:30.085+09:00">设立职官是用以保全生命。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:55:36.094+09:00">现今世上那些胡涂的君主，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:55:44.039+09:00">大量设立职官反而妨害了生命的成长．</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:55:52.667+09:00">这就失去了设立职官的意义了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:56:10.095+09:00">比如修整兵器，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:56:13.136+09:00">是用来防备敌寇的侵略，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:56:19.471+09:00">现在修整了兵器反而用来自相残杀，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T00:56:20.053+09:00">这就失去了修整兵器的意义了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:19:05.148+09:00">不是用生命去供养外物。【性养：用生命来养。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:18:26.052+09:00">本来是用来滋养生命的，【性：此指生命。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:20:20.638+09:00">糊涂到用自己生命的消耗去追求外物的享受，【【以性养物：用生命的消耗来追求外物的享受。物：指一切外物。货物及狗马声色味等均是。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:22:36.012+09:00">就必定灭亡，是不可幸免的。【无幸必亡：俞抛认为是倒句，即必然灭亡，无可幸免。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:04:08.541+09:00">水的本性是清的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:04:34.654+09:00">用泥土来搅动它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:04:40.803+09:00">所以水就不清了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:06:13.164+09:00">人的本性是长寿的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:17:59.224+09:00">用外物来搅动它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:18:03.534+09:00">所以人就不能长寿了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:18:07.986+09:00">外物这些东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:20:02.802+09:00">现今世上的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:20:41.828+09:00">这就是不知什么叫轻，什么叫重了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:20:52.344+09:00">不知什么叫轻、什么叫重，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:20:58.327+09:00">那就会把重的看为轻的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:21:04.362+09:00">把轻的看为重的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:21:08.253+09:00">像这样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:21:14.192+09:00">无论做什么，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:21:49.008+09:00">用这样的态度来做君主，就会成为迷惑糊涂的君主；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:21:52.741+09:00">用这样的态度来做臣子，就会成为乱臣贼子；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:22:08.508+09:00">用这样的态度来做儿子，就会成为轻狂顽劣的人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:22:31.712+09:00">这三种情况，国家只要有了一种，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:42:27.341+09:00">有幸得到了这些东西，【遁：高诱注：“流逸不能自禁也。”即今讲的无节制。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:26.845+09:00">耳听了肯定满意，【慷 qiè 怯）：满足。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:16.171+09:00">【2.3】 现在有一种声音在这里，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:35.957+09:00">听了就使人耳聋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:39.199+09:00">必定不会去听它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:43.719+09:00">有一种颜色在这里，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:49.655+09:00">眼睛看了肯定满意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:54.104+09:00">看了就使人眼瞎，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:40:57.322+09:00">必定不会去看它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:01.056+09:00">有一种滋味在这里，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:05.108+09:00">口吃了肯定满意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:09.102+09:00">吃了就使人变哑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:23.245+09:00">必定不会去吃它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:30.733+09:00">所以圣人对千声音、颜色、滋味等物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:34.317+09:00">有利千生命成长的就吸取它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:38.284+09:00">有害于生命成长的就舍弃它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:41:45.487+09:00">这就是保全生命的方法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:42:02.695+09:00">世上富贵的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:42:07.156+09:00">对于声音、颜色、滋味等物大多迷惑依恋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:42:16.595+09:00">白天夜晚地去追求，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:43:15.662+09:00">毫无节制地去追求外物的享受，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:43:22.744+09:00">哪能不受到伤害呢？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:49:49.884+09:00">【2.4】 一万个人拿着弓箭共同射</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:04.928+09:00">嗅觉灵敏了，【臭(xiù 秀）：本指气味。此指嗅觉灵敏。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:23.629+09:00">人体三百六十节处处都通畅。【三百六十节：古人认为人体骨节有三百六十节。在《恃君览· 达郁》中也有：“凡人三百六十节，九窍、五藏、六府＂。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:49:57.548+09:00">击一个箭靶，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:50:05.493+09:00">这个箭靶没有不被射中的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:50:15.174+09:00">万物繁众，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:50:21.878+09:00">如果用它来伤害一个生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:50:25.801+09:00">这个生命没有不受伤害的；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:50:43.484+09:00">如果用它来促成一个生命的成长，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:05.434+09:00">这个生命没有不成长的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:11.344+09:00">所以圣人在制约万物时，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:26.286+09:00">其目的是用以保全天所创造的生命。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:46.053+09:00">生命保全了，那么精神就和谐了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:53.203+09:00">眼睛明亮了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:51:57.467+09:00">听觉灵敏了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:09.424+09:00">口齿表达能力增强了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:49.54+09:00">像这样的人：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:53.612+09:00">不说话就有信义，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:52:56.598+09:00">不谋划就极妥当，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:02.513+09:00">不思虑就会有所得；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:06.761+09:00">他们的精神不但通达天地，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:10.673+09:00">而且覆盖宇宙；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:19.747+09:00">对千外物他们没有不能承受的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:24.705+09:00">也没有不能包容的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:28.772+09:00">就像天地那样；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:48.521+09:00">这样的人，上做天子不骄傲，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:51.212+09:00">下为百姓不烦恼。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:53:57.149+09:00">这样的人，才叫做德操完全的人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:54:51.702+09:00">富贵而不懂得养生的方法，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:55:15.21+09:00">恰好能带来祸患，与其这样，还不如贫贱为好。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T02:02:34.588+09:00">贫贱的人要得到物品是很难的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T02:02:34.654+09:00">出门有车，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T01:59:58.615+09:00">即使想要过份的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:21:40.292+09:00">入门有辇，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:21:44.558+09:00">务必追求自己的安逸享乐，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:22:01.899+09:00">这样的车，可以叫做颠倒人的机器。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:22:13.286+09:00">肥美的肉，醇香的酒，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:22:17.426+09:00">务必使自己尽力享受，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:23:41.763+09:00">这样的肉和酒，可以叫做腐烂肠子的食物。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:23:45.166+09:00">柔弱娇媚而牙齿洁白的美女，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:23:56.14+09:00">郑、卫等地的靡靡之音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:14.623+09:00">务必使自己尽情享受，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:22.726+09:00">这种美女和音乐，可以叫做砍伐性命的利斧。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:27.715+09:00">这三个祸患，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:31.847+09:00">都是富贵所招致的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:37.75+09:00">所以古人有不肯富贵的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:41.113+09:00">原因是重视生命的缘故，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:47.171+09:00">并不是虚夸其名，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:56.078+09:00">而是为其实啊。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T04:24:56.634+09:00">那么，这些议论是不可以不考察了解的。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
